WEBVTT

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.010
Father!

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.100
Father!

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:46.050
Someone!

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:47.470
Hey!

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:48.210
Anyone!

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:49.990
Call a physician!

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:51.450
Call a physician, now!

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.220
Is no one here?!

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:15.790
I'm sorry!

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:19.150
Ah, I'd like some hot water,

00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:21.800
along with as many clean 
cloths as you can spare.

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.850
Understood.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:25.810
Nobu...

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:27.420
Mitsu.

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:31.090
The assailant cannot have gone far.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.120
Was he sent by Takeda or Uesugi?

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:34.690
Mitsu?

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:38.490
What happened?

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:40.830
What's wrong, Mitsu?

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:42.920
Nobukatsu-sama has...

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.520
Nobukatsu? What about him?

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:47.100
Nobukatsu-sama

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:50.440
has passed away...

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:33.110
Nobukatsu.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.350
Why?

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:40.010
He looks at peace.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:52.800
What brother would leave his 
older brother behind?!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.830
You are far greater a fool than I!

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:11.360
Dammit!

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:14.440
Dammit!

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:20.820
What tragedy...

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.340
Nobukatsu-sama!

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.020
Is the killer still at large?

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:29.010
I am sorry.

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:31.830
I have deployed ten platoons 
around the castle perimeter.

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:34.160
By dawn, they will search our borders—

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:34.840
Don't bother.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.650
I am sure he has already left our lands.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:43.000
It's my fault.

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:47.600
Because I'm worthless,

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:50.350
Dad, Nobukatsu, and Himiko are all...

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.860
Oda Nobunaga is the fool 
everyone makes him out to be!

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:56.560
Nobunaga...

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:09.600
Ichihime-sama.

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:12.870
Mitsuhide?

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:18.100
Why not rest awhile?

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:20.880
I will watch over Nobukatsu-sama.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.510
No...

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:26.560
I want to stay with him, at least tonight.

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:28.630
Mitsuhide.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:29.390
Yes, my lady?

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:34.610
How long will these war-torn days last?

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:39.570
I don't remember when, but Brother told me

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.830
that he will bring an end to the chaos.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:44.070
Yes...

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:47.410
Please lend him your strength.

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:54.670
I, Mitsuhide,

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:58.020
have always been prepared to lay 
down my life for Nobunaga-sama!

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:18.140
What is the matter?

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:24.530
For you.

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:29.710
I couldn't do anything...

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:34.820
I thought you were here to determine 
whether he is fit to be the Savior-King.

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:38.160
If only I was stronger...

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:42.870
Nobuhide and Nobukatsu might still live.

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:47.740
Does that bother you?

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.410
Wait.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.950
There is no need for that.

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:01.420
Your demeanor says it all.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.260
How often you blink,

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:04.600
how you sound,

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.890
how you move your hands, 
how you center yourself...

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:10.640
They all indicate unshakable resolve.

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:16.340
Thank you for the tea.

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.530
This is...

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:33.950
Caesar-dono, why did you 
kill Lord Oda Nobuhide?

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:36.290
Customer service.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:40.960
The Takeda clan is an important business 
partner to our Star of the West.

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.870
It's a service to 
arrive without introduction

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:46.960
and kill my archenemy 
by taking him unawares?

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:51.720
Is it not your goal to strengthen 
your territory, amass wealth,

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:56.470
win battles, and gain dominion?

00:07:57.430 --> 00:08:00.530
In exchange for your wealth, 
we sell you technology

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:03.470
to help you fortify your military.

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:05.490
It's give-and-take.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.720
Mutual dependence, if you will.

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:15.150
Yes, it's a complicated business.

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:18.990
I see the abacus suits 
you more than the sword.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:25.060
Unfortunately, I am a stubborn man.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:28.680
I will not accept help from a guest 
in dealing with politics at home.

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:32.590
Look at Caesar's face.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.110
It's good medicine.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.910
He thinks everyone else is a fool.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:41.160
Soon, the blood of vengeful 
samurai will pour forth!

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.470
How exciting!

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:44.920
Scary.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.090
So exciting!

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:50.330
It must have been the Takeda's doing!

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.620
They have taken both Nobuhide-sama

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:54.530
and Nobukatsu-sama, as well!

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:56.500
How dare they?!

00:08:57.170 --> 00:08:58.520
The Takeda must be destroyed!

00:08:58.520 --> 00:08:59.910
It shall be a war of vengeance!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:04.000
No, the Takeda are not the only suspects.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.630
It could have been the Imagawa 
or the Uesugi, as well.

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:10.050
But why would they come all the way to Owari?

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:14.820
Perhaps to play us against the Takeda.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:19.660
I believe the perpetrators 
have not gone far.

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:23.620
What is the basis of this belief?

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:26.630
Mitsu.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.100
What do you think?

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:30.880
Mitsu!

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:34.370
Well...

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:41.850
I believe the Takeda are the 
ones we should first suspect,

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:42.880
given the situation.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.690
That's decided, then.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:50.010
Decided?

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:51.390
What's been decided?

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:57.000
I will ask Lord Shingen who 
struck down Himiko and Nobukatsu.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.040
What?!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.050
That's...

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.400
Are you insane?

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:04.050
I have no idea.

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:06.900
Apparently, I'm a fool.

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.520
This is no time for jokes.

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:11.130
At worst, it may start a battle.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:13.360
At best, you may lose your head.

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:14.910
Don't get me wrong.

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:17.110
I'm not going to start a fight.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.670
I'm just going to talk.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.120
I'll go, too.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:40.760
You amaze me, Monkey!

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:43.510
When'd you learn to pilot this ship?

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:47.510
Oh, I just asked those girls...

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:50.240
though it wasn't cheap.

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:02.350
Well, it seems this is our current juncture.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:05.490
The Hierophant...

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.880
the teacher of secret knowledge.

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:10.230
What does this card signify?

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:15.010
Is Shingen the teacher, 
and Nobunaga the learner?

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:18.710
That would not make for a very 
entertaining banquet.

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:27.350
The Fool is moving out!

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.670
Good luck.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.420
Now then, I wonder how 
Lord Shingen will respond.

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:47.600
Come out, Ranmaru.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:50.090
How did you know?

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.720
Like I said, you smell of orchids.

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:55.050
Want some?

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:56.630
No, I'm fine.

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:58.980
Well?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.770
Why are you here?

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:02.510
I...

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:03.620
Well, no matter.

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.270
A white flag?

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:27.420
Before you is the Oda clan lord,
 Oda Nobunaga.

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:29.640
He seeks audience with Lord Shingen!

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.220
I serve you.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:34.150
I will follow you anywhere.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.150
Very well!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:50.670
Well met, Nobunaga-dono.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:54.170
I am delighted to be so honored.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:03.930
What manner of man rides 
right into his enemy's ranks?

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:07.180
That hair... A woman?

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:10.620
So, what is your business with me?

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:12.900
I'd like to ask you a question.

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:19.120
Did you send an assassin after 
me and my brother, Nobukatsu?

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:23.310
Silence!

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.030
Nobunaga!

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:27.690
What is your answer?!

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:32.830
I did no such thing.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:40.350
I see.

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:41.610
Let's go, Ranmaru.

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:42.210
What?

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.000
My business here is done.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:47.030
Lord Shingen is not the 
one who tried to kill me.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:48.920
What? How do you know?

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:51.910
It's written all over his face.

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:54.650
He thinks he can crush Oda 
without such cowardly tactics.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:12.670
I presume your advisors are in an uproar.

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:15.950
You came here to defuse the 
situation and establish order.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:17.700
You've seen right through me.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:21.740
Achieving unity among one's 
advisors is no easy task.

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:25.610
But don't you say, "men are your castle,
 men are your castle walls"?

00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:30.600
You have guts! I like it!

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:35.970
But my reputation would be 
ruined if I were to let you leave.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:39.240
One of you, bring sake!

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:41.950
It was inevitable.

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:49.410
Well, then.

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:50.990
Let us now, with honor...

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:54.940
...do battle!

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:57.990
What?! Why?!

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:04.010
You said you were only here to talk!

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:07.580
How can I face such a warrior and leave

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:09.270
without engaging him in battle?!

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:12.060
There is no need to intervene.

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:13.810
But, my lord!

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:14.920
Understood?!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.150
Yes, my lord!

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.520
I am Takeda Shingen

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:01.320
here on the Fuurin Kazan, infused with the

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.260
Great Spirit of Suou!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.690
I am Nobunaga, son of Oda Nobuhide!

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:11.670
Here with my flesh and blood, The Fool!

00:16:14.670 --> 00:16:16.530
I request a duel!

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:19.740
And I will answer, Fool-brat!

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.740
Takeda Shingen!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.350
My lord!

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:34.560
Trample that Nobunaga fool into dust!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:45.230
Don't feel so bad about Nobuhide-dono.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:47.640
Such things happen in war-torn times!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:49.470
It was inevitable.

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:52.990
It was just his time!

00:16:58.170 --> 00:16:59.650
Amazing...

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:09.390
How oppressive.

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:11.710
What now, Caesar?

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.530
Will you just let them be?

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:16.830
Well, who knows?

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:22.760
Be as fast as the wind!

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:31.180
In raiding and plundering, be like fire!

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:39.980
Nobunaga!

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:48.460
Regalia, be my strength!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:53.600
Be as lightning!

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:01.190
My lord!

00:18:01.190 --> 00:18:01.730
I can't see!

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:02.780
Clear the air!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.430
There's no mistake!

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.480
This is a massive shift in the ley line!

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:12.550
The harmony of the universe 
will activate the Regalia

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:14.490
and cause the very quanta to tremble.

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.270
Shingen-sama!

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:20.460
My lord!

00:18:21.930 --> 00:18:24.290
Hmm, you can't see anything.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:27.200
That Oda brawler isn't bad.

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.640
<i>Shingen....</i>

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:29.660
Nobunaga...

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:41.120
I never expected to meet any but Kenshin

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:43.800
who deserved my full attention!

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:45.230
How joyous!

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.850
Men should look closely if they

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.630
have not seen the other for three days!

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:51.660
I'm not the same man I was yesterday!

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.710
I have dreamed of world 
domination for many moons.

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:59.670
To think that I must stake my life 
upon the likes of you, a great fool—

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:03.110
the Great Spirit of Suou seems to 
harbor a great love of nonsense.

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:05.460
Wrong!

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:08.360
You should thank that Great Spirit of yours

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:11.520
for the great honor of having fought

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:13.850
Oda Nobunaga, who will rule heaven and earth!

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:23.030
You jest, you fool!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:28.730
I told you! You'll burst a 
blood vessel some day, old man!

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.760
A two-headed dragon has been 
born on the Star of the East,

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:39.140
as though the old and the new now interlock.

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:42.240
Their secret truth is beknownst only to...

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:05.430
Prepare yourself!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.790
I have lost.

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:36.000
Well done, great fool.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.670
Regalia of fire...

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.850
You have done well.

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:48.350
I hereby release you from our bond of blood.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:52.450
Serve Oda Nobunaga henceforth.

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:03.530
Go forth and obtain heaven and earth.

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:06.700
You are a true man among men.

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:09.120
I, Nobunaga, will carry on your will.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.400
Now, Regalia of wind,

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.400
your will also accept 
Nobunaga as your new mast—

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:19.130
Shingen!

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:23.880
Let's not be too hasty, shall we?

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:25.530
You bastard!

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:26.350
Caesar!

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:35.390
Here you go.

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:37.160
Got it!

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:39.150
Imps?

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:43.030
Damn!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:44.660
Time to retreat, Ranmaru!

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:45.860
Now!

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:51.070
You are a coward, Oda Nobunaga!

00:21:57.750 --> 00:21:59.050
Shingen!

00:22:05.980 --> 00:22:07.590
Damn it!

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:12.590
My lord...

00:22:13.230 --> 00:22:13.930
What sorrow...

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:20.320
I saw the fool of Oda strike 
Lord Shingen in the back,

00:22:20.320 --> 00:22:21.870
then flee!

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:24.670
Oda Nobunaga must not be forgiven!

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:31.310
I, Gaius Julius Caesar,
 shall avenge his death at any cost!

00:22:32.440 --> 00:22:33.290
Right!

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:34.800
We must do battle for vengeance!

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:39.150
We will avenge our lord without fail!

00:24:12.290 --> 00:24:15.380
<i>An alluring land, and beautiful women...</i>

00:24:15.980 --> 00:24:17.550
<i>All to be mine...</i>

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:19.550
<i>or so it should have been.</i>

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:22.290
<i>Next time: Wands.</i>

00:24:22.960 --> 00:24:24.950
<i>I will show you my chivalry.</i>
